                                                "text": "In my experience, the best fillet knife is the Victorinox. I’ve personally been using it for the past 6 months with no problems, even after multiple sharpening. Having had dozens of filleting knives over the years, we’ve learned what makes a worthy filleting knife to add to the kitchen."
